cat > NOTES.md <<'EOF'
Preserve-mode authoring: two sections; supplied copy, destinations, IDs, tokens, original control rules and analytics/details script retained. No dependencies or external services.

Selected R1/R2: text-only entrance (0/80/160 ms) and once-only viewport reveal (0/80 ms), 600 ms, cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1), opacity .75→1 and Y 14→0 px. Controls and their ancestors remain static; content is visible without JS. Reduced motion cancels animation.

Selected R3/R4: verified repository fixtures assets/scene.webm and poster.svg (rights.json). Silent decorative looping video; separate icon pause/play control. Desktop 6:7 panel, mobile 16:10 at ≤767 px; cover crop 75% center for poster/video. Copy sits on paper. No loop fade selected without runtime evidence. Offscreen/hidden pages pause; reduced motion, unavailable observation, errors or disabled JS retain poster; rejected play allows retry. Page exit cleans observers/listeners; cached page return resyncs playback.

Limitations: browser/runtime, codec playback, loop boundaries, moving-frame crop, responsive rendering and keyboard interaction are unverified, reserved for the central observer. No browsers, server, downloads or second verification workflow used. Source check only; no build step.
EOF
